# Nhung gi KHONG duoc chep vao container khi build.
#
# Vi sao tep nay bat buoc phai co:
#   Dockerfile.hardened dung mau toi uu cache - chep .csproj truoc, `dotnet
#   restore`, roi moi `COPY . .` va publish voi --no-restore. Neu thu muc obj/
#   cua may Windows lot vao buoc COPY, no ghi de len project.assets.json ma
#   restore vua sinh trong container, va file do tro toi cac duong dan
#   C:\Users\... khong ton tai trong Linux. Ket qua la publish nổ voi MSB4018.
#
# Ngoai ra tep nay con hai tac dung an ninh that:
#   - .git/ chua TOAN BO lich su. Chep vao image nghia la moi bi mat tung bi
#     commit nham roi xoa di deu nam trong san pham giao cho khach.
#   - bin/, obj/ lam image phinh to va keo theo cac ban sao thu vien cu.

# San pham bien dich - phai dung ban build trong container, khong dung ban cua may
bin/
obj/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Lich su git va cau hinh CI
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Ket qua quet - khong lien quan toi ung dung
reports/
*.sarif

# Cong cu va tai lieu
tools/
semgrep-rules/
*.md
ground_truth.csv

# CSDL SQLite - ung dung tu tao lai luc khoi dong
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite

# Tep cua IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
